5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know the total cost before we commit. Let's look at the offshore house pricing and the all-in rates.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’m done with the logistics. I want to see how last year’s days actually ran and what the ferry schedule looks like.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to understand the payment structure. I’ll look into what separately booked rooms cost last time and the all-in rates.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I need to know the bathing hours and how the inn rooms are arranged.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand the group dynamic. I’ll look into time alone in the shared-house year and how last year’s days ran.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if the ferry eats two days, that’s a huge chunk of our week gone before we even start.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, I know. That’s exactly why I’m checking it. I need to see if the train option saves us that time.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, knowing the room layout helps, but I need to know if the money is fixed or variable.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, I’m not worried about the yen. I’m worried about where I wash and when I have to sit down.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the layout matters, but I’m trying to understand why we felt disconnected. Did the shared house actually isolate us?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if we’re all in one house, we can’t just vanish. I need to know if that’s a good thing or a trap.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, it’s not a trap, it’s a constraint. I’m checking if the train option gives us back those lost days.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, a single bill prevents the quiet imbalances we’ve had. I’m checking the all-in rates to see if that solves it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin, I’m not vanishing, I’m sleeping. I need to know if I can wash without waiting for the whole house.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, I’m not asking you to vanish. I’m asking if the structure itself caused the distance.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, I’m just saying, if I can’t get a moment to myself, I’ll be grumpy. I need to know if that’s possible before I agree.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, I’m not promising you solitude, just a shorter transit. I’m checking the train times to see if we keep more of the week.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, a single bill prevents the quiet imbalances we’ve had. I’m checking the all-in rates to see if that solves it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
