43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"-Takumi: Baths open until midnight, but the island house has one bathroom for everyone. I can’t sleep if I’m waiting for hot water.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the shared house had no private space. The town has streets. I need to know if the structure caused the distance.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
