63,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"Dinner at six, breakfast at half seven. I can wash until midnight. I’m voting for the hot spring town.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,The town has streets and public baths. We can be together without being trapped. I’m voting for the hot spring town.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
